  <p id="c-jinshu-010-xieyan-xiehun:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">隆安四年
五月
己卯，會稽內史<persName id="c-jinshu-010-xieyan-xiehun:p001:m0015" ref="aa6_83c_juy_BA">謝琰</persName>爲<persName id="c-jinshu-010-xieyan-xiehun:p001:m0018" ref="a7f_c0a_373">孫恩</persName>所敗，死之。</p>
  <p id="c-jinshu-010-xieyan-xiehun:p002" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">義熙八年
九月
己卯，太尉<persName id="c-jinshu-010-xieyan-xiehun:p002:m0013" ref="3qs_nqa_ioa_AAA">劉裕</persName>害右將軍兗州刺史<persName id="c-jinshu-010-xieyan-xiehun:p002:m0023" ref="0ky_guf_s9d">劉籓</persName>、尚書左僕射<persName id="c-jinshu-010-xieyan-xiehun:p002:m0031" ref="aa6_83c_juy_BAC">謝混</persName>。</p>
</text>
